### Chạy từng request trong IntelliJ IDEA (HTTP Client có sẵn) hoặc VS Code (extension "REST Client").
### Server phải đang chạy ở http://localhost:8080 (xem README).

@base = http://localhost:8080/core-api/tenants
@hunter = Bearer hunter1-token
@admin = Bearer admin-token

### 0. Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/healthz

### 1. Xin upload token (cấp case id + folderPath). Copy 3 giá trị trả về vào request 2.
POST {{base}}/tenant-a/cases/@/upload-token
Authorization: {{hunter}}

### 2. Tạo case (thay FOLDER_PATH và UPLOAD_TOKEN bằng kết quả bước 1)
POST {{base}}/tenant-a/cases
Authorization: {{hunter}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "item": {
    "tenantId": "tenant-a",
    "name": "Lateral movement host-07",
    "priority": "high",
    "assigneeIds": ["u-hunter2"],
    "filenames": ["host07.zip"],
    "folderPath": "FOLDER_PATH",
    "uploadToken": "UPLOAD_TOKEN"
  }
}

### 3. Danh sách case (lọc, sắp xếp, phân trang)
GET {{base}}/tenant-a/cases?status=open,in_progress&sort=-createdTime&offset=0&limit=20
Authorization: {{hunter}}

### 4. Admin xem mọi tenant
GET {{base}}/MASTER/cases
Authorization: {{admin}}

### 5. Xem chi tiết (trả kèm uploadToken mới dùng cho Update)
GET {{base}}/tenant-a/cases/65f000000000000000000001
Authorization: {{hunter}}

### 6. Cập nhật (UPLOAD_TOKEN lấy từ bước 5)
PUT {{base}}/tenant-a/cases/65f000000000000000000001
Authorization: {{hunter}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "item": {
    "tenantId": "tenant-a",
    "name": "Ransomware host-01 (đã cập nhật)",
    "priority": "high",
    "assigneeIds": ["u-hunter2"],
    "filenames": ["logs_1.zip", "logs_extra.7z"],
    "folderPath": "/tenant-a/65f000000000000000000001",
    "uploadToken": "UPLOAD_TOKEN"
  }
}

### 7. Xóa (xóa mềm)
DELETE {{base}}/tenant-a/cases/65f000000000000000000001
Authorization: {{hunter}}
